WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.728
Both arms forward, ready!

00:00:02.218 --> 00:00:04.113
Instead of raising the white flag lower it!

00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:06.646
Keep white still and raise blue!

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.045
Lower blue and raise white!

00:00:10.115 --> 00:00:11.389
Hold both flags still!

00:00:12.459 --> 00:00:13.792
Raise the flag that’s down!

00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:17.332
Don’t lower both flags, lower only blue!

00:00:18.402 --> 00:00:19.747
Raise blue and lower white!

00:00:20.817 --> 00:00:22.150
Raise the flag that’s down!

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.335
Lower both flags!
